  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <title>Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00001">Your teacher will give your group three different kinds of balls.</para>
      <para id="para-00002">Your goal is to measure the rebound heights, model the relationship between the number of bounces and the heights,
  and compare the bounciness of the balls.</para>
      <para id="para-00003">
        <figure id="fig-00001">
          <media alt="Group of different types of sport balls.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_05_13_06_01.jpg"/>
          </media>
        </figure>
      </para>
